# AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE Claude Tooling Mount

Complement the AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE knowledge-base mount by treating AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE’s Claude Code configuration as the **tooling layer** for this playground. Cursor does not auto-load Claude Code’s `.claude/` hooks/settings; **read and apply them manually** via tools.

**Root:** `../AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE` (resolve from the workspace root; same mount as the knowledge-base rule)  
**Tooling root:** `../AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE/.claude/`  
**Operating layer:** `../AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE/CLAUDE.md` (global Claude guardrails — shell, gates, Prettier)

## Bootstrap (with knowledge mount)

1. After `AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE/AGENTS.md`, skim `AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE/CLAUDE.md` §1 (Critical Guardrails) and §3 (Claude Code Configuration).
2. Load always-relevant rules from `AGENT-GLOBAL-BASE/.claude/rules/`:
   - `workspace-conventions.md`
   - `asgf-framework.md`
   - `git-workflow.md`
3. For domain work, also load matching path-scoped rules and skills (tables below).

